{"asked":[{"category":"scope","id":"Q-6","impact":3,"impactReason":"Controls which orders can be placed.","options":["Show in-stock/low/out-of-stock only; out-of-stock items can still be ordered as back-orders","Show in-stock/low/out-of-stock only; out-of-stock items cannot be added to the basket","Show exact quantities; ordering is limited to the quantity available"],"reason":"Simplest approach, because the imported stock is a snapshot and isn't reserved.","recommended":"Show in-stock/low/out-of-stock only; out-of-stock items can still be ordered as back-orders","score":6,"spans":["§76 ERP stock import","§76 Basket","§76 Checkout"],"text":"Can customers order items that are out of stock, and what stock do they see?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-7","impact":3,"impactReason":"Sets the delivery dates stored on orders.","options":["A daily order cut-off time: orders before it get next-working-day delivery, orders after it get the day after; cut-off time is configurable","Customers pick a delivery date from allowed delivery days set for each customer or route","Fixed delivery days per customer, with no date choice at checkout"],"reason":"The smallest rule set that still counts as delivery scheduling.","recommended":"A daily order cut-off time: orders before it get next-working-day delivery, orders after it get the day after; cut-off time is configurable","score":6,"spans":["§76 Delivery scheduling rules","§76 Checkout"],"text":"What are the delivery scheduling rules?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-8","impact":3,"impactReason":"Creates financial records.","options":["One invoice per order when it is marked Dispatched; sequential numbers generated by the portal","One invoice per order when it is placed; sequential numbers generated by the portal","Invoices come from the ERP; the portal only stores and displays them"],"reason":"Bills only for goods that were sent, and needs no ERP write-back.","recommended":"One invoice per order when it is marked Dispatched; sequential numbers generated by the portal","score":6,"spans":["§76 Automated invoice creation","§76 Invoice PDFs"],"text":"When is an invoice created automatically, and how are invoice numbers assigned?","uncertainty":2}],"assumptions":[{"fromQuestion":"Q-6","fromSpan":["§76 ERP stock import","§74 Integrations: ERP CSV import"],"id":"ASM-21","risk":"high","text":"How does the ERP CSV import reach the portal, and how often? → assumed: Admin uploads the CSV manually in the portal whenever needed"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-7","fromSpan":["§76 ERP stock import","§76 Product administration","§76 Price-list administration"],"id":"ASM-22","risk":"high","text":"What does the ERP CSV contain: stock levels only, or products and prices too? → assumed: Stock levels only (per SKU); products and prices are managed in the portal"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-8","fromSpan":["§76 ERP stock import","§74 QA: Import testing"],"id":"ASM-23","risk":"high","text":"What happens when an import file has bad rows (unknown SKU, invalid quantity)? → assumed: Import the valid rows, skip the bad ones and show a row-level error report"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-9","fromSpan":["§76 Customer-specific pricing","§76 Price-list administration"],"id":"ASM-24","risk":"high","text":"How does customer-specific pricing work? → assumed: Each customer company is assigned one price list; products not on it use the standard list price"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-12","fromSpan":["§76 Order tracking","§76 Order cancellation","§74 Backend: Order state transitions"],"id":"ASM-25","risk":"high","text":"What order statuses are there, and up to which status can a customer cancel? (Orders can't be amended, so cancelling is the only way to change one.) → assumed: Placed → Confirmed → Picking → Dispatched → Delivered, plus Cancelled; customers can cancel until Picking, staff can cancel any time before Dispatched"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-13","fromSpan":["§76 Order tracking"],"id":"ASM-26","risk":"low","text":"Does order tracking include courier tracking numbers or links? → assumed: Portal order status only, no courier integration"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-15","fromSpan":["§76 Payment status","§74 DevOps: Scheduled jobs"],"id":"ASM-27","risk":"high","text":"Payment status is tracked rather than collected. Is 'overdue' set by hand, or worked out from payment terms? → assumed: Automatically: the invoice becomes overdue once its due date (from the customer's payment terms) passes unpaid; staff mark it paid"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-16","fromSpan":["§76 Customer-specific pricing","§76 Automated invoice creation"],"id":"ASM-28","risk":"high","text":"Do prices, invoices and PDFs need to show VAT/tax, and in which currency? → assumed: Single currency; prices shown excluding VAT and invoices show VAT at one standard rate"},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q-17","fromSpan":["§76 Role-based access","§76 Product administration","§76 User administration"],"id":"ASM-29","risk":"high","text":"With the three roles (customer user, staff, admin), what can admin do that staff can't? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-18","fromSpan":["§76 Order history","§76 Saved basket templates","§74 QA: Customer data-isolation testing"],"id":"ASM-30","risk":"high","text":"There are no company-level roles. Does every customer user see all of their company's orders, invoices and templates? → assumed: Yes: all users in a company see all of that company's orders, invoices and templates"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-19","fromSpan":["§76 Staff-created orders"],"id":"ASM-31","risk":"high","text":"When staff create an order for a customer, which prices apply and is the customer told? → assumed: The customer's own prices and delivery rules apply; the customer gets the normal order-confirmation email; the order records which staff member created it"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-20","fromSpan":["§76 Delivery CSV export"],"id":"ASM-32","risk":"low","text":"What is the Delivery CSV export for, and who uses it? → assumed: Staff download a CSV of orders due for delivery on a chosen date (fixed columns) to give to the warehouse/carrier"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-21","fromSpan":["§76 Vehicle compatibility search","§74 Backend: Vehicle compatibility"],"id":"ASM-33","risk":"high","text":"Where does vehicle compatibility (fitment) data come from? → assumed: Admins maintain it in the portal (make/model/year per product), with CSV upload"},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-22","fromSpan":["§76 Email notifications"],"id":"ASM-34","risk":"low","text":"Which events send email notifications? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromDefault":"sign-in","fromQuestion":"Q-23","fromSpan":["§76 Customer authentication"],"id":"ASM-35","risk":"low","text":"For invite sign-in: do invites expire, and can users reset forgotten passwords themselves? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on."},{"fromDefault":"reporting","fromQuestion":"Q-24","fromSpan":["§76 Reporting","§76 CSV exports"],"id":"ASM-36","risk":"low","text":"Which reports are needed? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder."},{"fromDefault":"audit","fromQuestion":"Q-25","fromSpan":["§76 Audit history"],"id":"ASM-37","risk":"high","text":"What does the audit history record? → assumed: Who created and last changed each record, and when; no full audit trail."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-26","fromSpan":["§76 Seven-year order/invoice retention","§75 Technology Stack"],"id":"ASM-38","risk":"high","text":"Does seven-year retention mean keeping data for at least seven years, or deleting it after seven years? → assumed: Keep for at least seven years; no automatic deletion"},{"fromDefault":"data-migration","fromQuestion":"Q-27","fromSpan":["§76 Customer/company management","§76 Product catalogue"],"id":"ASM-39","risk":"high","text":"Is there existing data to load at launch (customers, users, products, price lists, past orders)? → assum